{"a":[26,30],"h":"<p>28.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"232\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 232.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.0 30.0 36.7 54.7 66.0 66.0 81.7 81.7 88.4 95.2 95.2 102.0 108.7 124.4 124.4 131.2 140.2 140.2 147.0 167.2 174.0 182.2 189.0 195.7 207.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.7 88.4 108.7 131.2 147.0 174.0 182.2 189.0 195.7 207.7 216.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve bu tevhid kelimesini İbrahim akabınde, ya'ni zürriyyetinde bir kelimei bâkıye kıldı - «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"231\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 231.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 19.6 27.8 27.8 34.6 34.6 41.3 48.0 65.3 65.3 72.0 78.8 78.8 85.6 101.3 101.3 110.3 117.0 117.0 126.0 126.0 133.6 133.6 140.3 140.3 156.0 156.0 162.8 171.0 171.0 186.8 198.0 198.0 198.0 211.6 219.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.3 48.0 85.6 162.8 211.6 219.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » sûrei «Bakare» ye bak. Yâhud Allah onu onun zürriyyetinde ibka buyurdu. Onun için onun zürriyyetinde Allahı tevhid eden hiç eksik olmadı.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"132\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 131.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 54.0 54.0 61.6 77.3 77.3 86.3 86.3 94.6 94.6 101.3 108.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 61.6 94.6 101.3 108.0 115.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ki rücu' edeler - dalâle şirke düşenler muvahhidlerin ıhtarı ile o kelimeye dönsünler 29.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 50.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.0 33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> fakat rücu' etmediler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"69\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 68.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 35.3 35.3 35.3 35.3 43.6 43.6 43.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 52.6\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şunlar, Resulullaha muasır olanlar, ezcümle Kureyş 31. </p>"}